# reel's hero demo: reel showing itself off, on Musicbox (a sketchpad for chord progressions) playing its default song,
# recorded with its own sound and narrated by two voices.
# `mise run demos` records it (Musicbox built in ~/Projects/musicbox: by path, since a bundle id can find another copy). It plays music and takes the mouse and keyboard.
Import //demos/reel.reelpreset
Launch ~/Projects/musicbox/build/App/Musicbox.app

Output //docs/media/musicbox.mp4
Output //docs/media/musicbox.gif
Set Size 1440x900
# The second voice: the preset's voicebox:Main speaks every other line.
Set Voice guest voicebox:Michael
# reel's own stings open and close it (design/motion, set in the preset): the background alone, 2 s. The square cut
# has no sting in its shape, so it gets title cards on the designed backgrounds instead.
Intro@crossfade,ease-out,600ms square ? "reel" "Demo videos from a script" : 2s
Outro@fade,800ms square ? "Recorded with reel" "brew install --cask mpdreamz/tap/reel" : 2s

Hide
Wait #lanes
# Into the window's empty title bar first: the first click into it only makes it key, and would miss the mute. Every
# lane shows with Musicbox's drawer closed: `defaults write dev.musicbox.app drawerOpen -bool false` before recording.
Click @175,18
Sleep 1s
Show

Say "Reel is an app that records demos of macOS apps and web pages."
Say "Here we're recording a sneak peek at Musicbox, a fun new DAW that's still being worked on."
Say@guest "Every click, key and zoom in this video is a line in a script."
Say@over "Press space, [play] and Musicbox plays, with its own sound."
Wait [play]
Key space
Sleep 1.5s
Zoom #lane.drums.mute 3x
Say@guest,over "Mute the drums, [mute] and the chords and melody carry on alone."
Wait [mute]
Click #lane.drums.mute
Sleep 1s
Zoom #timeline.melody 1.8x
Say "Zooms find what they show by name, and follow it."
Zoom #lane.drums.mute 3x
Say@guest "Now, let's bring that beat back!"
Click #lane.drums.mute
Sleep 1.5s
Zoom off
Say "The music ducks under our voices, subtitles carry them to muted feeds, and one reel renders every cut."
Say@guest,over "Space again, [stop] and that's a take."
Wait [stop]
Key space
Sleep 1s
